From: Bluefin factory maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Qualify workspace loader package IDs in integration tests

The test feature graph also contains registry glycin-image-rs 2.2.0.
Select the local workspace loaders explicitly instead of an ambiguous name.

--- a/glycin-loaders/meson.build
+++ b/glycin-loaders/meson.build
@@ -74,7 +74,9 @@

 test_args = []
 foreach loader : get_option('loaders')
-  test_args += ['-p', loader]
+  loader_package = 'path+file://' + (
+    meson.project_source_root() / 'glycin-loaders' / loader)
+  test_args += ['-p', loader_package]

   cargo_build = custom_target(
     loader,
